      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IDEAL TIGER NZ (1) finished third last start over 2200m at Marburg, beaten 3 metres, after a good win at this track the run prior. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Faces a similar assignment. Good enough to take out a race like this. MAYWYNS KAREN (9) has been racing well, filling a top-five position at her last four starts including a third most recently at Albion Park over 2138m. Hard to know where she gets from this slightly awkward draw. Perfectly placed and is sure to prove tough to beat again. ULTIMATE HUNTER (3) missed the placings two runs back then did a great job to score by 7 metres despite breaking in the run over 1780m at this track a week-and-a-half ago. Has the benefit of a good draw. Won't find this any harder and he will be competitive again. BRITTS MATE NZ (2) has drawn to advantage and should give backers a great sight.",
